showing services, traffic, lane details, road signs, speed limits, and a reference map with GERS ID." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">TomTom GEM</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Simplify data exchange and geospatial data management</span></p></div></div></a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="relative" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="DividerLine"><div><div class="w-full" data-component-name="DividerLine"><div class="h-1 opacity-20 bg-black"></div></div></div></div><div class="relative spacer-top-s" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="Article"><div><div class="article article--6-column-text-allcenter" data-component-name="article"><div class="article__image article__image--6-column-text-allcenter article__image--empty"><div style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="article__texts article__texts--6-column-text-allcenter" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="article__texts__wrapper"><div class="article__title"><p><span id="navigation"><span class="headline1">Navigation</span></span></p></div><div class="article__body"><p><span id="nav"><span class="bodyintro2">Utilize advanced navigation tools for accuracy and efficiency</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative spacer-top-s spacer-bottom-s" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="CenteredCards"><div><div class=""><ul class="tt-grid gap-y-40 tablet:gap-y-gutter"><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/tomtom-ai-agent/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/6cce503b58/iva-og_1200x630px.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://medi