bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/6e2822de37/nav_sdk_automotive_header_og_1200x630px.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/6e2822de37/nav_sdk_automotive_header_og_1200x630px.jpg" alt="Car GPS screen displaying a 3D city map with directions. A hand is visible on the steering wheel in the dimly lit interior." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Automotive Navigation</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Enhance the in-vehicle experience with configurable, quick-to-integrate navigation</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/navigation-sdk-for-mobile/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/3dddf7b8a8/nav_sdk_mobile_header_og_1200x630px.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/3dddf7b8a8/nav_sdk_mobile_header_og_1200x630px.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/3dddf7b8a8/nav_sdk_mobile_header_og_1200x630px.jpg" alt="A digital map interface showing a navigation route, coding snippets, and travel statistics like speed and estimated arrival time." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Navigation SDK for mobile</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Build navigation apps with optimized routing, accurate ETAs and real-time traffic</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/adas-sdk/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/a58ff38478/virtual-horizon-isa_header_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/a58ff38478/virtual-horizon-isa_header_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/a58ff38478/virtual-horizon-isa_header_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg" alt="Virtual Horizon" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">ADAS SDK</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Know what lies ahead with up-to-the-minute ADAS map info</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/roadcheck/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c6eacd6c7c/og-roadcheck.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c6eacd6c7c/og-roadcheck.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c6eacd6c7c/og-roadcheck.jpg" alt="Aerial view of a complex road interchange with signs indicating where automated driving is prohibited and permitted, set against an urban backdrop." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">RoadCheck</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Industry-first tool for when, where and under what conditions AD can be activated</span></p></div></div></a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="relative" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="DividerLine"><div><div class="w-full" data-component-name="DividerLine"><div class="h-1 opacity-20 bg-black"></div></div></div></div><div class="relative spacer-top-s" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="Article"><div><div class="article article--6-column-text-allcenter" data-component-name="article"><div class="article__image article__image--6-column-text-allcenter article__image--empty"><div style="opacity:1"></div></div><div class="article__texts article__texts--6-column-text-allcenter" style="opacity:1;transform:none"><div class="article__texts__wrapper"><div class="article__title"><p><span id="traffic"><span class="headline1">Traffic</span></span></p></div><div class="article__body"><p><span id="traffic-solution"><span class="bodyintro2">Explore our suite of traffic solutions</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative spacer-top-s" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="RichArticle"><div><div class="rich-article"><div class="rich-article__content rich-article__content--bg-white"><div class="rich-article__title"><p class="subheadline1 text-red"><span>Traffic is life</span></p><p class="headline1"><span>TomTom Traffic</span></p></div><div class="rich-article__body"><p class="body1"><span>TomTom Traffic is setting the standard in the traffic management industry. With our real-time traffic data and advanced road analytics, we empower you to make informed decisions. We offer a range of cutting-edge tools and services designed to optimize traffic management and enhance operational efficiency for businesses.</span></p></div><div class="rich-article-ctas" data-component-name="rich-article-ctas"><div class="rich-article-ctas__colored-cta"><div class="button button--bg-brand-red button--size-small"><a class="button__link" href="/tomtom-traffic/" tabindex="0" data-subcomponent-name="button Learn more"><span class="button__link-first-text">Learn more</span><span class="button__link-first-icon"><i class="button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="10" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 10"><path fill="#fff" d="M5.5 8.5 7 10l5-5-5-5-1.5 1.5L8 4H0v2h8z"></path></svg></i></span><span class="button__link-second" aria-hidden="true"><span class="button__link-second-text">Learn more</span><span class="button__link-second-icon"><i class="button__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="12" height="10" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 12 10"><path fill="#fff" d="M5.5 8.5 7 10l5-5-5-5-1.5 1.5L8 4H0v2h8z"></path></svg></i></span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="rich-article__visual"><div class="image image--basic image--background"><img class="image__image" alt="Empty highways" width="1200" height="630" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/7cbf55ca2e/tomtom-traffic-overview-og.jpeg"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative spacer-top-s spacer-bottom-s" style="background-color:#f2f2f2" data-component-name="CenteredCards"><div><div class=""><ul class="tt-grid gap-y-40 tablet:gap-y-gutter"><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/tomtom-move/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/60c109ce00/move_og.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/60c109ce00/move_og.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/60c109ce00/move_og.jpg" alt="tomtom-move-og" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">TomTom MOVE</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Ready-to-use reports and data visualizations from our traffic analytics tools</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/area-analytics/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/f3d5892409/area_analytics_header_og_1200x630px-jpg.jpeg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/f3d5892409/area_analytics_header_og_1200x630px-jpg.jpeg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/f3d5892409/area_analytics_header_og_1200x630px-jpg.jpeg" alt="Map showing congestion data for Hauts-de-Seine, including congestion level, speed, free flow speed, travel time, and road network length." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Area Analytics</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Get traffic insights for custom areas and timeframes</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/traffic-stats/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/8f83dcf173/traffic_stats_og_1200x630pc.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/8f83dcf173/traffic_stats_og_1200x630pc.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/8f83dcf173/traffic_stats_og_1200x630pc.jpg" alt="Traffic stats" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Traffic Stats</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Access historical data on road speeds, travel times and traffic density</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/origin-destination-matrix-analysis/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/44dc78a273/og-origin-destination-analysis.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/44dc78a273/og-origin-destination-analysis.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/44dc78a273/og-origin-destination-analysis.jpg" alt="Aerial view of a cityscape with highlighted highways showing traffic percentages. Skyscrapers in the background under a cloudy sky." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Origin Destination Analysis</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Analyze trip patterns and drivers’ preferred routes</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/route-monitoring/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c9ac670138/og-route-monitoring.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c9ac670138/og-route-monitoring.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/c9ac670138/og-route-monitoring.jpg" alt="Two men monitoring multiple CCTV feeds and maps on wall-mounted and desk screens in a surveillance control room." width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Route Monitoring</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Track traffic on key routes and share live info with road users</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/junction-analytics/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/716a555431/product-junction_analytics_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg"><span class="inline-block bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat" style="background-image:url(https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/716a555431/product-junction_analytics_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg/m/1200x630/filters:blur(80):quality(10))"><img class="" src="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/716a555431/product-junction_analytics_og_1200x630px_srgb.jpg" alt="Junction Analytics" width="1200" height="630" loading="lazy"/></span></span></div><div class="flex grow flex-col justify-between gap-24 p-24 xl:p-40"><h3><span class="headline3">Junction Analytics</span></h3><div><p class="body2"><span>Monitor and improve the performance of your traffic light network</span></p></div></div></a></li><li class="col-span-4 tablet:col-span-2"><a class="group flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-20 bg-white" data-subcomponent-name="CenteredCardsItem" href="/products/historical-traffic-volumes/"><div><span class="flex flex-col gap-12" role="figure" aria-labelledby="https://media.tomtom.com/f/178460/1200x630/a01b136303/og-historical_traffic_volumes-desktop-1200x630px.png"><span cla